Depends: agos (>= 2.0.0-2), ss-webos (>= 2.0.0-11), mdesk (>= 3.0.0-6), mote-mcpd (>= 3.0.0-3), cx-agent (>= 0.3.4-3), uchat (>= 2.0.0-3), mote-vault-sync (>= 1.1.0-3), mote-vault-syncd (>= 1.1.0-3), mote-secd (>= 1.0.0-2), codex-mesh (>= 1.0.0-2), obsidian (>= 1.13.7), model-router (>= 0.1.0-1), model-llm (>= 0.1.0-3)
Description: Agent Computer application composition preview
 Composes native Agent intelligence, WebOS, desktop, Obsidian, chat, vault
 sync, security, MCP capabilities, and CX through APT and DPKG dependencies.
 Mote MCPd retains the on-demand stdio MCP interface.
 Obsidian requires its reviewed official upstream DEB.
 This composition does not establish Agent Apps or Agent Computer readiness.
